:"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T11:18:00Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T11:18:00Z","body":"CC @DarioSamo ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495444263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499163494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99576#issuecomment-2499163494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99576","id":2499163494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U9jVm","user":{"login":"BlackShift","id":5866818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjY4MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5866818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift","html_url":"https://github.com/BlackShift","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T22:27:07Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T22:48:00Z","body":"I found a work around,\n\nSetting certain properties, marks the material as dirty, but doesn't call `_update_shader()`\nby getting the the RID of the material, you can force this update to occur. Changing the MRP's code will work to include this fix in-game, but the editor would need a tool script.\n\n```\nextends Node3D\n\n\nfunc _on_check_button_toggled(toggled_on: bool) -> void:\n\tif toggled_on:\n\t\t$MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material(0).texture_filter = StandardMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS\n\telse:\n\t\t$MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material(0).texture_filter = StandardMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST\n\t$MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material(0).get_rid()\n```\n\nWhen would it be desirable to call this update? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499163494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499193990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99576#issuecomment-2499193990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99576","id":2499193990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U9qyG","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T22:49:47Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T22:49:47Z","body":"There should be no need to do that, I'll investigate how to fix the regression during the week.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499193990/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500933692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99576#issuecomment-2500933692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99576","id":2500933692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VETg8","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T14:22:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T14:29:58Z","body":"> Setting certain properties, marks the material as dirty, but doesn't call _update_shader()\n\nThat's pretty much the reason behind the regression yes. I took out the calls to _update_shader() as we needed to defer shader updates to the moment the RID is requested. However, it seems not all properties equally fire off an event to notify others that the material has been updated.\n\nCalling `notify_property_list_changed();` afterwards does fix it, but I feel that carries a heavier cost than it seems to be at first, and there seems to be some pattern behind whether the callback is called or not on the other setters.\n\nI'll see what options we have to fix this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2500933692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501367441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99576#issuecomment-2501367441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99576","id":2501367441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VF9aR","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T16:41:44Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T16:41:44Z","body":"You can check out https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99716 and see if it fixes the issue and doesn't introduce any others.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501367441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505045441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99576#issuecomment-2505045441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99576","id":2505045441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VT_XB","user":{"login":"BlackShift","id":5866818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjY4MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5866818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift","html_url":"https://github.com/BlackShift","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T00:30:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T00:30:39Z","body":"I tested the patch and it does fix it for the MRP.\n\n> However, it seems not all properties equally fire off an event to notify others that the material has been updated.\n\nI would imagine the reason behind this is due to a difference of a bound uniform vs code change in the shader output.\nThis might also be something that we expose via `bind_methods()` for the user to control. But I'm worried it would break backward compatibility. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505045441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]